From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Oleksii Kulinich <entaytion@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 12 Sep 2026 17:37:06 +0300
Subject: Add proxy list management: bulk delete/ping, and save without connecting

- "Delete Failed Proxies": remove every saved proxy that failed its last check in one tap
- "Ping All Proxies": force-recheck every saved proxy now, ignoring the usual cooldown
- adding a new proxy has a "Connect immediately" toggle, so it can be saved without switching to it
---
